        "text_preview": "\nHe is not a habitual offender and no other criminal case is registered against him, therefore, taking a lenient view in the light of change in law by repealing Act of 1954 and enacting Act of 2006, jail sentence may be set aside and approp"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3c39e94d253c4a9497e0ee1e0ee2a2e9_30",
        "summary_section": "arguments",
        "labels": [
          "ARG_PETITIONER"
