        "text_preview": "On the basis of aforesaid discussion, this criminal revision is partly allowed upholding the conviction under Section 7(i) read with Section 16(1)(A)(i) of the Act of 1954, jail sentence is set aside and cumulative penalty of Rs.3,00,000/- "
      },
      {
